{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the depths of space\u2026 Your ship, guided by its own autopilot, faces endless waves of alien threats. It maneuvers on its own, dodges incoming fire, and never stops firing back. So what\u2019s your role in this battle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.poster.avif?t=1758308153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.webm?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.mp4?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the mind behind the ship. With your deck of strategic cards, you upgrade, enhance, and transform it into a deadly war machine. Each new card unlocks an advantage\u2014stronger shields, deadlier weapons, or faster maneuvers. Your choices decide whether the ship survives or is lost to the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.poster.avif?t=1758308153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.webm?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.mp4?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there\u2019s your ultimate trump card: the <strong>Omega Device</strong>. A single blast from this devastating weapon can light up the darkness of space\u2014but only you can decide when to unleash it. Use it carelessly, and you may be left defenseless against the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your typical space shooter. Instead of struggling with tricky controls, you focus purely on strategy and progression. While the ship fights automatically, you\u2019re constantly pushing it to become stronger, faster, and tougher. Beneath the calm rhythm lies a relentless pressure: you will always need more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.poster.avif?t=1758308153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.webm?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.mp4?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself\u2014because here, victory doesn\u2019t belong to quick reflexes alone. It belongs to your strategy, your upgrades, and your ability to outlast the storm.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960770?t=1758308153","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960770?t=1758308153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/f24e9ecb698808857cad92f841497817555a3c44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758308153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/f24e9ecb698808857cad92f841497817555a3c44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758308153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4034090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the depths of space\u2026 Your ship, guided by its own autopilot, faces endless waves of alien threats. It maneuvers on its own, dodges incoming fire, and never stops firing back. So what\u2019s your role in this battle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.poster.avif?t=1758308153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.webm?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.mp4?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the mind behind the ship. With your deck of strategic cards, you upgrade, enhance, and transform it into a deadly war machine. Each new card unlocks an advantage\u2014stronger shields, deadlier weapons, or faster maneuvers. Your choices decide whether the ship survives or is lost to the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.poster.avif?t=1758308153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.webm?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.mp4?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there\u2019s your ultimate trump card: the <strong>Omega Device</strong>. A single blast from this devastating weapon can light up the darkness of space\u2014but only you can decide when to unleash it. Use it carelessly, and you may be left defenseless against the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your typical space shooter. Instead of struggling with tricky controls, you focus purely on strategy and progression. While the ship fights automatically, you\u2019re constantly pushing it to become stronger, faster, and tougher. Beneath the calm rhythm lies a relentless pressure: you will always need more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.poster.avif?t=1758308153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.webm?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.mp4?t=1758308153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself\u2014because here, victory doesn\u2019t belong to quick reflexes alone. It belongs to your strategy, your upgrades, and your ability to outlast the storm.</p>","developers":["IBELF Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/a0df036569748dc447afee9f613f7ed5a09252f9/header.jpg?t=1758308153","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 or equivalent (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> No dedicated GPU required (integrated graphics is sufficient)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 (Mojave) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel x64<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960770/1338631842/221ef4361f2504c44784a6a7f1126b9c08e9123f/1758306046/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758307887","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960770/1338631842/221ef4361f2504c44784a6a7f1126b9c08e9123f/1758306046/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758307887","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960770/1338631842/221ef4361f2504c44784a6a7f1126b9c08e9